<p class="kt-adv-heading9_c6cdfc-57 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading t-p" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading9_c6cdfc-57"><b>Hiding out-of-stock products.</b> The page and its search ranking disappear, and so does the chance to collect emails.</p>
